ow alewives feed Chinook salmon, lake trout and cormorants.", "matters": "Joined to Lake Huron through the Straits of Mackinac, it acts as one lake, the largest body of fresh water on Earth by surface area. Introduced fish now support a popular salmon sport fishery."}